# Boost headers for bundled PaPILO

- Upstream: https://www.boost.org/
- Version: 1.90.0
- License: Boost Software License 1.0 (`LICENSE_1_0.txt`)

This is the transitive, header-only subset used by PaPILO 3.0.0. It contains
all textual Boost include dependencies plus generated/preprocessed headers for
the supported compiler families. No Boost binary library is included or
linked.
